Blessings upon you, Lord Bomba!

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:19.700
Blessings, blessings!

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.000
Still, it could be fun if we think of it as a vacation, right?

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.000
Blessings, blessings!

