00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:58.040
Big Brother! It's the ocean, the ocean!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:02.040
She sure did want to come.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:02.040
Maybe I'll bring her here sometime. 

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:02.040
The ocean! That's Umaru's ocean!

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:05.410
