00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:30.410
A vacation with Taihei...!

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:30.410
A vacation with Taihei! A vacation with-!

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:31.910
What are you doing here?!

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.500
Umaru has joined your business trip, Big Brother!

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:42.200
Go home!

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.040
C'mon, let me tag along for a bit. 

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.790
This isn't a game, you know!

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.120
I won't go back until I've tasted eel!

